Z||000010||Smoooooth GT||08-16-2001||09:28 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by TwisT:<BR><B>Interesting bumper...  what's the scoop on that???</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I made the rear fascia myself...  The part in the middle(lower) was a part that I cut out of another front fascia... The part was just laying at my feet one day at the bone-yard...lol  was mean't to be I guess...  The tail light's are a set from Ferrari-momo..  He's oversea's still I think..(a prayer for his girlfriend)...  as she is sick in some way... He uses the money from Fiero Part sales to pay for thing's for her and his trip.. I think..  Steve||||reg||1
